  "body": "Brand-New Coastal Living in the Macleans College Zone\r\n\r\nTitle & CCC Issued – Ready to Move In!\r\n\r\n8A, 8B & 8E SOLD – Only 8C & 8D Remaining!\r\n\r\nDiscover modern coastal living in these beautifully designed, brand-new homes, just a short stroll from the beach in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to Bucklands Beach Domain, Bucklands Beach Primary School, the scenic coastal walkway to Half Moon Bay, and Howick Golf Club. Half Moon Bay Marina is just minutes away, offering cafés, restaurants, a gym, supermarkets and ferry services to Auckland’s CBD.\r\n\r\nZoned for the highly sought-after Bucklands Beach Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, these homes offer an excellent lifestyle for families. A bus stop is just a two-minute walk away, with direct services to Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate.\r\n\r\n8C – Contemporary Terrace Home\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this home offers:\r\n• Three upstairs bedrooms, plus a downstairs study that may be used as an additional bedroom if required (consented as a study)\r\n• Family bathroom upstairs and a guest powder room downstairs\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flowing onto a private deck\r\n• One allocated car park\r\n• Four heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n• Underfloor heating in the bathroom\r\n• Quality kitchen appliances, including an oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher and waste disposal unit\r\n• Security intercom and alarm system\r\n• 8D – Contemporary Terrace Home\r\n\r\nOffering comfort, convenience and a thoughtfully designed layout, this home features:\r\n• Two upstairs bedrooms, plus a downstairs study that may be used as an additional bedroom if required (consented as a study)\r\n• Stylish family bathroom upstairs and a guest powder room downstairs\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area opening onto a private deck\r\n• One allocated car park\r\n• Four heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n• Underfloor heating in the bathroom\r\n• Quality kitchen appliances, including an oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher, microwave and waste disposal unit\r\n• One Bosch Washer Dryer Combo\r\n• Security intercom and alarm system\r\n\r\nYour Coastal Lifestyle Awaits\r\nWith three homes already sold and only 8C and 8D remaining, don’t miss your opportunity to secure your new home in the Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nVisit our open homes or contact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
